  <data name="textBoxDescription.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>[Description]
- This Program support windows 98 ~ 7
- This program usage is for lock directory by give type to directory

[Warning]
- Don't uses this program about system directory

[Change Log]
---Ver 1.1 Premium---
-Fix a bug in Path Reminder

---Ver 1.0 Premium---
- 99% use of 'Krypton Component'
- Change UI Function and Style
- Change path memorizing function

---Ver 3.1---
- Change some UI function
- Change and improve Background function
- Use Image file instead of program Resource

---Ver 3.0---
- Some Small Fixes
- Change UI panel
- Add ability to remind 10 paths

---Ver 2.2---
- Change UI panel
- Add ability allow you to keep last path
- Ability to set Background Skin in several size mode
- More UI function, for easy usage
- Setup project added , for install and copy some program font on your system

---Ver 2.1---
- Fixed some bug in unload folder
- Added Button to open Folder fast from program

---Ver 2.0---
- " . " (Dot) Problem Fixed!!! Now you can use many Dot in your folder name
- Fixed find manual type code(when you give a type to your folder manual)
- More security, now you can set password for yourself
- Added security question for lock ,unlocked folder in close program
- Theme ability added
- More UI function, for easy usage

[Bugs]
No Transparent for Information panel

[Contact address]
 mimosh_pisholack@hotmail.com
 khoropof@aol.com
 (Please use Persian or English language)
</value>
